# Renders and writes the tunnel-compare PDF report for an already-produced
# compared cloud. Runs in its own node/process (see
# scripts/report_export_action_server.py) specifically so the heavy,
# mostly-Python PDF/report rendering (weasyprint, matplotlib, Open3D
# offscreen rendering) never runs inside the UI process - that used to hold
# the GIL long enough to fully freeze the UI even though it ran on a
# background QThread there.
#
# site_name/job_name/applied_thickness/tolerance/date/time are computed by
# the caller (UI already has JobStore/JobInfo for this - see
# ui/compare_cloud_worker.py's CompareWorker for the same pattern) rather
# than looked up here, so this node has no dependency on the ui package.

# ===== Goal =====
string compared_ply_path   # .ply of the compared cloud, already saved to disk
string output_pdf_path     # where to write the PDF report
string site_name
string job_name
float32 applied_thickness  # mm
float32 tolerance          # mm
string date
string time

---
# ===== Result =====
bool success
string report_path         # final report path ("finalreport" copy if one was made)

---
# ===== Feedback =====
float32 progress
string stage
